{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年國際足協東盟挑戰盃（決賽）今晚在啟德主場館舉行，香港隊以2:0擊敗柬埔寨。上半場第41分鐘，安永佳接應孫銘謙的傳球先開紀錄，帶領港隊領先完上半場。下半場第54分鐘，陳肇鈞在禁區內被踢跌，球證判罰12碼，艾華頓主射命中，將比數拉開至2:0。下半場補時六分鐘雙方再無入球，香港隊最終以2:0擊敗柬埔寨，奪得國際足協東盟盃D2級別冠軍。現場有超過3.1萬名球迷入場。國際足協會長恩芬天奴、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩等均有到場觀戰。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-42-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-59-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-65-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-56-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-66-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-40-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-54-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-35-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src